# `agents.list`

List all agents as minimal IndexEntry rows.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.agents.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`AgentIndexResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `items` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.list --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "rust-lane",
      "scope": "project"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-reviewer",
      "scope": "project"
    }
  ]
}
```
